    "title": "Gas station proposed for Holliday Farms hits procedural bump - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Durham ,\n5 hours ago A decision on a controversial gas station and convenience store proposed for Holliday Farms will wait at least a month. The Zionsville Plan Commission was supposed to hear the project June 15. However, because certain rules were not followed by the petitioner — Carmel-based engineering consultant Keeler-Webb Associates — the commission opted to push the matter to July. Read full article",
